   "body": "Captures #168 and #173 are done in #386 (merged as b4a18b5). An expired session gets one `.hop`, \"Identifiants invalides !\" with a refresh to `/unlog.php`, on both the home page (`R70a`) and the flags page (`R70b`). See HFR-PROTOCOL §6c LOT-047, LOT-024 and LOT-044. Classifying it is #383.\nThis lot still waits on the last capture of its list, #109: `forum1f.php?owntopic=1` with nothing flagged. Both kit accounts follow topics, and emptying a list means flag writes (`delflag`) on an operator account, which the last Mac session's mandate (private MP writes only) excluded. Left `status: blocked`.\nOptions: (a) approve those flag writes on user2 for the next Mac session; (b) let this lot start now and treat the empty flags page as *pending capture*, reported as \"no information\". Decision needed (operator)",
